WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.000
What is the untold

00:00:01.025 --> 00:00:02.437
secret behind the mastery

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:03.737
of một khả năng

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:04.712
hoàn toàn khác

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:06.350
AI không chỉ làm

00:00:06.412 --> 00:00:07.474
việc cho con người

00:00:07.550 --> 00:00:07.787
nữa

00:00:08.884 --> 00:00:10.471
Every masterpiece begins with

00:00:10.484 --> 00:00:12.171
meticulous preparation and

00:00:12.196 --> 00:00:13.746
precision engineered down to

00:00:13.746 --> 00:00:14.396
the millimeter

00:00:15.532 --> 00:00:16.919
Each cut requires steady

00:00:16.969 --> 00:00:18.344
hands and immense patience

00:00:18.694 --> 00:00:19.881
where even a tiny

00:00:19.894 --> 00:00:21.394
mistake cannot be tolerated

00:00:22.444 --> 00:00:23.394
And when every joint

00:00:23.431 --> 00:00:25.206
fits together seamlessly it

00:00:25.219 --> 00:00:26.569
reveals a timeless work

00:00:26.606 --> 00:00:27.806
of art crafted without

00:00:27.806 --> 00:00:28.544
a single nail

00:00:29.692 --> 00:00:30.417
That is the pure

00:00:30.479 --> 00:00:31.954
essence of true dedication

00:00:32.967 --> 00:00:33.966
Which detail of this

00:00:34.004 --> 00:00:35.304
process surprised you the

00:00:35.304 --> 00:00:35.754
most

